# The Lodestone Array (CIPlay lodestone_array): a sky island 35 m up; the landing ring (manual, screechers, locker,
# generator, coil status), the four arms' coils in order (a coil out of order refuses), the "Coils offline" board, the
# west arm cache; the glass bridge (it breaks), the beam (emitter, two mirrors, the core door), the iron guardian, the
# core warning, the core cutoff and the core (zone core: the plan's done-when, it brings the Array Root).
island The Lodestone Array
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Shutting the Crown
zone ring
expect step 1
read Array operating manual
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Ring locker
wait 3
expect step 4
use generator
expect story arraypower 1
expect step 5
read Coil status
expect step 6
zone north_arm
expect step 7
use northcoil
expect story coilnorth 1
expect step 8
zone east_arm
use southcoil
expect story coilsouth 0
use eastcoil
expect story coileast 1
zone south_arm
use southcoil
expect story coilsouth 1
zone west_arm
use westcoil
expect story coilwest 1
expect shown coilsoff
expect step 14
read Coils offline
expect step 15
open West arm cache
wait 3
expect step 16
use cutoff
expect story crownoff 0
zone bridge
expect shown bridgebroken
expect step 17
beam emitter
use mirror1
use mirror2
wait 2
beam emitter
expect story beamset 1
expect step 18
kill Bear
expect step 19
read Core warning
expect step 20
use cutoff
expect story crownoff 1
expect step 21
zone core
storespot 22 -12
expect done
